    "summary": "Wargear, 1 CP. Use it in the Fight phase of either player's turn. Choose one of your LEAGUES OF VOTANN INFANTRY units that is yet to be picked to fight this phase; you may also spend 3YP. For the rest of the phase, its models re-roll every Hit roll of 1 when attacking, and also every Wound roll of 1. Spending YP on this use lets them re-roll any Wound roll instead of only 1s.",
